Application **26/01297/PPP** is for **four houses (planning in principle)** on land north of Kirk Brae.

According to our records, it has been **decided and refused**, with the decision issued on **9 September 2026**. The consultation period has closed, so no further comments can be submitted on it.

If you want to understand the reasons for refusal, or whether the applicant could appeal or submit a revised scheme, the decision notice on the planning register will set out the reasons. If you have concerns about future development on this land, you can also contact the planning desk to ask about any new applications that come in.
